{
  "dom_id": "step-77820",
  "name": "Example: \n                    Dividing a Negative Number by a Positive Number",
  "problem": "Find the value of $-15 \\div 3.$",
  "worked_solution": "Here, we are dividing a negative number $\\color{red}(-15)$ by a positive one $\\color{blue}(3).$ So the result will be negative:\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14147219/assets/d1a8196b5a3bee794d65631eeef52c4c1e0196072ae4a73aa644cad0ef191925.svg)\n\nNow, to compute the number that goes in the box, we divide $15$ by $3$ without any signs: $15 \\div 3 = 5.$ Therefore, we get\n\n$$\n{\\color{red}(-15)} \\div {\\color{blue}3} = {\\color{red}-5}.\n$$",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
  "fields": [],
  "problem_field_keys": [],
  "answer_fields_complete": null,
  "result": null,
  "proof_feedback": null,
  "html": "<div id=\"step-77820\" class=\"step\" style=\"display: block\" stepid=\"77820\" steptype=\"example\" contentid=\"12972\">\n            <div class=\"stepHeader\">\n                <div class=\"stepName\">\n                    Example: \n                    <a id=\"stepAnchor-77820\" class=\"stepAnchor\" style=\"font-weight: normal;\" name=\"step-2\">Dividing a Negative Number by a Positive Number</a> \n                </div>      \n                <div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"77820\">?</div>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"exampleQuestion\">\n                <style type=\"text/css\">\n                            .mjpage .MJX-monospace {\n                            font-family: monospace\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage .MJX-sans-serif {\n                            font-family: sans-serif\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage {\n                            display: inline;\n                            font-style: normal;\n                            font-weight: normal;\n                            line-height: normal;\n                            font-size: 100%;\n                            font-size-adjust: none;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            text-align: left;\n                            text-transform: none;\n                            letter-spacing: normal;\n                            word-spacing: normal;\n                            word-wrap: normal;\n                            white-space: nowrap;\n                            float: none;\n                            direction: ltr;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            padding: 0;\n                            margin: 0\n                   